    {
      "heading": "Common constraints",
      "markdown": "`go { ... }` is a zero-argument block form. It may capture published const values and audited synchronization handles, but never an outer `var`, even for reads. Pass local data as explicit arguments with inline values, `copy(...)`, or `move`. Waiting is always `await task`; unique mutable results are taken once automatically. `await all` is homogeneous."
